Package: cinminai-daemon
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Cin-MinAI/Cin-MinAI>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, cinminai-llama (>= @RELEASE@), cinminai-table (>= @RELEASE@)
Recommends: network-manager, pulseaudio-utils, cups-client, pciutils, ubuntu-drivers-common
Description: Cin-MinAI assistant (the daemon)
 The assistant built into Cin-MinAI: it answers on the session bus as
 org.cinminai.Assistant1 for the sidebar, the panel applet and the other parts,
 and runs the model on this computer with llama.cpp (cinminai-llama). It picks
 the graphics card or the processor at each start, keeps graphics memory free
 for the desktop, and says so when it has to run smaller. This version has the
 guide's read-only tools: the built-in help, checking this computer, and opening
 programs. It carries the diagnostics too (cinminai-diag): fault codes with plain
 explanations and fixes, read from the kernel log, drivers, disks and packages.
 Nothing is sent over the network.
